OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 23,000 take part in the
OL,4,AGreat South Run
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 23,000 people have taken part
OL,7,Fin an annual 10-mile race through the
OL,8,Fstreets of Portsmouth.
OL,10,FThe AJ Bell Great South Run returned on
OL,11,FSunday, with runners starting on the
OL,12,Fseafront close to the Avenue de Caen
OL,13,Fand finishing near Southsea Castle.
OL,15,FParticipants enjoyed a fresh but sunny
OL,16,Fday for the event, which saw them go on
OL,17,Fa loop past some of the city's
OL,18,Fbest-known landmarks, including the
OL,19,FSpinnaker Tower, Portsmouth Harbour,
OL,20,Fthe dockyard complex and HM Naval Base.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
