OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 23,000 take part in the
OL,4,AGreat South Run
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose who took part were awarded with
OL,7,Fspecially designed blue and gold
OL,8,Fmedals, inspired by the Mary Rose, to
OL,9,Fmark Portsmouth's centenary as a city.
